{"sections":[{"slug":"充实范畴上的模","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"充实范畴上的模"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上的模</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"充实范畴上的模"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可视为单对象</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <strong><span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上的模</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是结合代数上的模和</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的共同的推广</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的模范畴</span> $\\mathsf{LMod}(\\mathcal A)$, $\\mathsf{RMod}(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是结合代数上的模范畴的推广</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其之间的等价是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注意</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">这里所说的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上的模</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的模</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">不同</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">后者指的是将</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的结合代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">然后考虑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">而前者中的充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">甚至不一定是结合代数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">但是</span>, $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴与</span> $\\mathcal V$ (<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">上的模是有关系的</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">确切地说两者之间有一个自由</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">遗忘</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":": $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的右模范畴</span> $[\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V]$ <span lang=\"zh\">是其自由生成的</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为余完备</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal A$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathcal A$-<strong><span lang=\"zh\">左模</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的范畴为充实函子范畴</span>\n$$\r\n    \\mathsf{LMod}(\\mathcal A) := [\\mathcal A,\\mathcal V],\r\n$$\n$\\mathcal A$-<strong><span lang=\"zh\">右模</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的范畴为</span>\n$$\r\n    \\mathsf{RMod}(\\mathcal A):=\r\n    \\mathsf{LMod}(\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}})=\r\n    [\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V].\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于两个</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)$-<strong><span lang=\"zh\">双模</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的范畴为</span>\n$$\r\n    \\mathsf{BMod}(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B) := \\mathsf{LMod}(\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}}) = [\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V].\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">双模又叫</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":" (profunctor).</p>\n<p>$\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">自身可作为</span> $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal A)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span> $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathcal V$, $(a,a')\\mapsto \\operatorname{Hom}(a',a)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">双模的张量积</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span> $M\\colon \\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">和</span> $(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal C)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span> $N\\colon \\mathcal B\\otimes\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">张量积</span></strong> $M\\otimes_{\\mathcal B}N\\colon \\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\nM\\otimes_{\\mathcal B} N (a,c):= \\operatorname{colim}_{b\\in\\mathcal B} M(a,b)\\otimes N(b,c).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模给出函子</span> $\\mathsf{RMod}(\\mathcal A) \\to \\mathsf{RMod}(\\mathcal B)$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">若将双模视为</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则双模的张量积是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的复合</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若将双模视为模范畴之间的函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则双模的张量积也是模范畴之间的函子的复合</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">中心</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">回忆环</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的代数</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/中心","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">中心</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $R$, <span lang=\"zh\">意味着</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $A\\otimes A^{\\mathrm{op}}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的自同态环为</span> $R$. <span lang=\"zh\">这推广为如下定义</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">中心</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"). <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的自同态对象为</span> $\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">的始对象</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $\\mathcal I \\to \\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}})$, $*\\mapsto\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">全忠实</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">中心</span></strong> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">生成元</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">回忆</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对环</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的代数</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathsf{Mod}(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生成元(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生成元</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是指</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}_A(M,-)$ <span lang=\"zh\">反映同构</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模同态</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为同构当且仅当</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(M,X) \\to \\operatorname{Hom}(M,Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $(A,B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则有函子</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(M,-) \\colon \\mathsf{RMod}(A) \\to \\mathsf{RMod}(B)$. <span lang=\"zh\">若该函子反映同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">强生成元</span></strong> (strong generator).</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">若</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{RMod}(B)\\to\\mathsf{RMod}(A),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n(F\\colon \\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal V)\\mapsto (A\\mapsto \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V)}(M(A,-),F))\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">反映同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">强生成元</span></strong>.</p>\n<h3>Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若如下等价条件成立</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathsf{RMod}(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\mathsf{RMod}(\\mathcal B)$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴相等价</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal A)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span>$$\r\nM\\otimes_{\\mathcal B} N \\simeq \\mathcal A,\\,N\\otimes_{\\mathcal A}M\\simeq\\mathcal B.\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于一个具体的双模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如下命题刻画了其何时为</span> Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">如下条件等价</span>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>$M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita范畴","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的可逆</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成了</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">若将</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为函子</span> $\\mathcal A \\to\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V)$, <span lang=\"zh\">则其沿米田嵌入的左</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{LKE}(M)\\colon \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V)\\to \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为等价</span>;</li>\n<li>$M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为强生成元</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有右伴随</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且函子</span> $\\mathcal A \\to\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal B^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V)$ <span lang=\"zh\">全忠实</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">双模的伴随即是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita范畴","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">小投射模</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">为交换环</span>, $A,B$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $(A,B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">有右</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">当且仅当</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为有限生成投射</span> $B$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">有右伴随</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">小投射</span></strong> (small projective) $(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">可分充实范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可分充实范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可分代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为小投射模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $\\mathcal A$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">可分</span></strong> (separable).</p>\n"}]}}}]}